# Beacon exports (snapshot source_sha256, artifact digests, /v1/status source
# evidence) are computed over the exact on-disk bytes of beacon.yaml and the
# canonical documents. Pin LF for every file that can feed an export so a
# Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) produces the same bytes as Linux/macOS.
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
examples/** text eol=lf
tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
